 the <strong>colors of dread</strong>. Don't be afraid, these are just stories, they can't hurt you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>?yeht naC</strong></i></h2>", "short_description": "Dive into the worlds of the best classic weird fiction and cosmic horror writers. Try out our original approach to bringing literature into the interactive medium. Relax and let Dr. Emmerson guide you through all the colors of dread.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361560/b195bacbdd0f8e63fd904bbad5c520c260bddf1c/header.jpg?t=1784801532", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361560/3c01227aa08fc64b615b6e35081f0bd04d03c346/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784801532", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361560/3c01227aa08fc64b615b6e35081f0bd04d03c346/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784801532", "website": "https://bitgolemgames.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/8.1/10 (x64)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5-2400 or Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 660 2GB VRAM or equivalent (GTX 970 for VR)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Wind